# Luvinico Project

Premium imported wine & beer landing site (personal/non-commercial). Vietnamese UI (`lang="vi"`).

## Monorepo layout

| Path | Stack | Purpose |
|------|-------|---------|
| `frontend/` | Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind v4 | Public site on **Cloudflare Workers** (OpenNext SSR) |
| `cms/` | Sanity Studio v6 | Content editing (project `sfqhf74q`, dataset `production`) |

Work in the correct package. Run `npm` commands from `frontend/` or `cms/`, not repo root.

## Brand & design

- Dark luxury aesthetic: `bg-premium-black`, `text-premium-gold`, `bg-premium-dark`
- Mobile-first, thumb-friendly CTAs, fast images
- Brand source: `frontend/src/data/brand.js`

## Legal (required)

Include age verification (Age Gate) **or** footer warning:
> Sản phẩm không dành cho người dưới 18 tuổi và phụ nữ mang thai

## Before finishing any task

Report audit:

- Performance: PASS / WARNING
- SEO: PASS / WARNING
- Accessibility: PASS / WARNING
- Maintainability: PASS / WARNING

Explain any WARNING. Verify Cloudflare Workers build (`npm run build` in `frontend/`) when touching frontend.
